    cat("\nInterpretation:\n")
    cat("These are model-based estimates, not raw sighting counts.\n")
    cat("For example, availability_by_occasion is the model-estimated average probability that individuals were available to be detected across sampling occasions.\n")
    cat("A dolphin can be available and still not detected, because detection probability can be less than one.\n")
    invisible(tab)
